WEBVTT

00:01.687 --> 00:06.027
<b>Long live... the Demon Lord...</b>

00:08.277 --> 00:10.407
<b>What a shameful mess!</b>

00:10.727 --> 00:13.347
<b>I'm supposed to be King Takuto's hero!</b>

00:16.267 --> 00:19.557
<b>Either way, it's time to report!</b>

00:19.557 --> 00:21.547
<b>King Takuto, I'm finished!</b>

00:21.547 --> 00:23.377
<b>The enemy was one of the Four Generals,</b>

00:23.377 --> 00:25.697
<b>and while I took a slight blow,</b>

00:25.697 --> 00:26.887
<b>I finished him off proper—</b>

00:27.287 --> 00:28.097
<b>Huh?!</b>

00:35.267 --> 00:38.067
<b>There's an enemy in Mynoghra?!</b>

01:12.767 --> 01:16.017
<b>What a beautiful, wonderful land.</b>

01:17.007 --> 01:18.707
<b>All of this...</b>

02:55.527 --> 02:57.037
Let's Launch Our Counterattack

02:58.457 --> 02:59.497
<b>My king!</b>

03:00.457 --> 03:02.577
<b>Enemy forces have entered the Accursed Lands!</b>

03:02.947 --> 03:04.917
<b>Yeah, I know.</b>

03:05.537 --> 03:07.177
<b>Please forgive me.</b>

03:07.177 --> 03:11.127
<b>Given the situation, I thought 
I should report to be sure.</b>

03:11.127 --> 03:16.507
<b>It's all right. Our king has the power to know
everything that happens within his domain.</b>

03:16.927 --> 03:21.217
<b>Our main forces, including 
Gia, are already on the move.</b>

03:21.217 --> 03:24.247
<b>We'll be moving to the 
residential area as well,</b>

03:24.247 --> 03:27.227
<b>so you should make haste back to your post.</b>

03:27.227 --> 03:29.657
<b>Yes! Understood!</b>

03:30.687 --> 03:32.087
<b>My king...</b>

03:32.567 --> 03:33.657
<b>Are things bad?</b>

03:33.977 --> 03:36.117
<b>No, we're fine.</b>

03:36.117 --> 03:39.277
<b>Master has me here, after all.</b>

03:39.277 --> 03:42.077
<b>There's nothing to be worried about.</b>

03:42.407 --> 03:45.917
<b>It is a little unpleasant though.</b>

03:45.917 --> 03:47.047
<b>Yes.</b>

03:47.047 --> 03:50.047
<b>I didn't think they would attack us here.</b>

03:50.047 --> 03:51.547
<b>What shall we do?</b>

03:51.927 --> 03:54.167
<b>There's a chance that the enemy's leader,</b>

03:54.167 --> 03:58.567
<b>this "Demon Lord," is another 
player like you, Master.</b>

03:58.567 --> 04:00.497
<b>So what if they are?</b>

04:01.137 --> 04:04.387
<b>It doesn't matter if they're a player or not.</b>

04:04.387 --> 04:07.047
<b>Peace between us would be 
difficult at this point.</b>

04:07.047 --> 04:10.777
<b>Atou's already taken down one 
of their Four Generals too.</b>

04:11.587 --> 04:14.567
<b>We'll crush them with our full might, Isla.</b>

04:14.997 --> 04:18.407
<b>As you command, my king.</b>

04:19.007 --> 04:22.237
<b>Now then, let's launch our counterattack.</b>

04:26.247 --> 04:28.457
<b>Let's confirm our forces.</b>

04:28.457 --> 05:09.787
<b>Isla, Queen of Bugs</b>

04:29.277 --> 04:31.507
<b>First, we have you, Isla.</b>

04:31.507 --> 04:36.797
<b>Yes. I will not bring shame 
to my title of Defense Hero.</b>

04:37.467 --> 05:09.787
<b>Head Warrior Gia</b>

04:37.907 --> 04:41.337
<b>Next, we have the Dark Elf 
Warriors led by Gia.</b>

04:41.337 --> 04:44.097
<b>There aren't many of them, but 
their morale is at its peak.</b>

04:44.097 --> 05:09.787
<b>Brain Eaters</b>

04:44.607 --> 04:47.737
<b>We also have the Brain Eaters.</b>

04:47.737 --> 04:49.417
<b>We only have three of them,</b>

04:49.417 --> 04:52.447
<b>but they possess healing abilities.</b>

04:52.447 --> 04:55.487
<b>I believe they'll prove 
reliable in this situation.</b>

04:55.487 --> 04:56.957
<b>Human!</b>

04:56.657 --> 05:09.787
<b>Larvae</b>

04:56.957 --> 05:00.547
<b>Lastly, we have the Larvae 
you've given birth to.</b>

05:00.547 --> 05:02.667
<b>I gave birth to Larvae intended for labor,</b>

05:02.667 --> 05:05.677
<b>but they should be able 
to fight to some degree.</b>

05:05.677 --> 05:09.787
<b>My presence here will supplement 
their abilities after all.</b>

05:11.437 --> 05:17.507
<b>Perhaps I should have anticipated 
this and birthed some Combat Larvae.</b>

05:17.507 --> 05:20.217
<b>There's no point in thinking about that now.</b>

05:20.217 --> 05:21.597
<b>That's right!</b>

05:21.597 --> 05:24.107
<b>Everyone is grateful to the Larvae!</b>

05:24.107 --> 05:25.177
<b>Uh-huh!</b>

05:25.177 --> 05:27.537
<b>Oh my, thank you girls.</b>

05:27.537 --> 05:30.437
<b>Let me give you a hug in thanks!</b>

05:36.107 --> 05:36.927
<b><i>My king.</i></b>

05:36.927 --> 05:37.877
<b><i>Emle?</i></b>

05:38.827 --> 05:39.867
<b><i>What is it?</i></b>

05:40.167 --> 05:44.287
<b><i>We've completed the evacuation of 
those who won't join the battle.</i></b>

05:44.287 --> 05:45.537
<b><i>Good work.</i></b>

05:45.537 --> 05:48.867
<b><i>We'll be heading there too, 
so we'll join you there later.</i></b>

05:49.317 --> 05:52.157
<b><i>Understood. I'll be waiting for you!</i></b>

05:52.157 --> 05:53.097
<b><i>Yeah.</i></b>

05:53.097 --> 05:54.297
<b><i>My king.</i></b>

05:54.297 --> 05:55.167
<b><i>Gia?</i></b>

05:55.167 --> 05:59.337
<b><i>I have a rough estimate on the number of 
enemies who entered the Accursed Lands.</i></b>

06:00.957 --> 06:06.547
<b><i>Both Emle and Gia are able to think for 
themselves and act without directions from me.</i></b>

06:06.547 --> 06:08.897
<b><i>This never would have happened in the game.</i></b>

06:08.897 --> 06:11.687
<b><i>I have reliable people working under me.</i></b>

06:11.687 --> 06:12.517
<b><i>My king?</i></b>

06:13.077 --> 06:14.567
<b><i>Oh, I'm sorry.</i></b>

06:14.567 --> 06:15.567
<b><i>So how many?</i></b>

06:15.567 --> 06:20.827
<b><i>I can see roughly a thousand enemies 
have invaded the Accursed Lands.</i></b>

06:20.827 --> 06:22.827
<b><i>In addition to Goblins and Orcs,</i></b>

06:22.827 --> 06:26.227
<b><i>I've also spotted some 
grotesque, unfamiliar creatures.</i></b>

06:26.227 --> 06:28.407
<b><i>You've done well. Thank you.</i></b>

06:28.807 --> 06:31.897
<b><i>Continue focusing on defending 
the area around our capital.</i></b>

06:31.897 --> 06:33.997
<b><i>I'll deal with the enemies.</i></b>

06:33.997 --> 06:35.267
<b><i>Understood.</i></b>

06:36.027 --> 06:38.007
<b>A thousand enemies, huh?</b>

06:38.007 --> 06:39.757
<b>That's certainly a lot.</b>

06:39.757 --> 06:41.877
<b>There's probably one of the 
Four Generals too.</b>

06:41.877 --> 06:45.007
<b>This is looking to be a tough battle.</b>

06:47.257 --> 06:50.717
<b>However, O great and mighty king,</b>

06:50.717 --> 06:53.397
<b>you've already determined 
our strategy, haven't you?</b>

06:54.177 --> 06:57.847
<b>Moments like these are precisely 
what our Mana Resources are for.</b>

06:57.847 --> 06:59.767
<b>We're facing an RPG.</b>

06:59.767 --> 07:03.697
<b>It's time to show them the 
strength of a 4X game.</b>

07:03.697 --> 07:08.847
<b>By which you mean creating Units 
with Emergency Production?</b>

07:08.847 --> 07:12.907
<b>Using that, you could easily 
overturn the difference in numbers.</b>

07:12.907 --> 07:16.677
<b>Being able to produce all the Units 
we want as long as we have Mana</b>

07:16.677 --> 07:18.967
<b>is an awfully advantageous mechanic for us.</b>

07:18.967 --> 07:19.997
<b>Isla.</b>

07:23.097 --> 07:28.507
<b>I'm granting you the entirety 
of Mynoghra's Mana reserves.</b>

07:30.647 --> 07:31.547
<b>What?</b>

07:34.337 --> 07:36.997
<b>Raise your level as much as possible.</b>

07:36.997 --> 07:41.587
<b>Be sure to acquire the skills 
Predation and Parasitic Eggs.</b>

07:42.677 --> 07:46.867
<b>Then use that power to overrun...</b>

07:50.137 --> 07:51.847
<b>all of our enemies!</b>

08:00.827 --> 08:02.617
<b>My, my, my!</b>

08:02.617 --> 08:05.477
<b>What a mean and spiteful person you're being!</b>

08:05.477 --> 08:09.217
<b>Entrusting me with everything 
during this crisis!</b>

08:09.617 --> 08:14.327
<b>I already have a general grasp of our 
foe's power from the battle in Dragontan.</b>

08:14.327 --> 08:16.277
<b>Even if one of the Four Generals is there,</b>

08:16.277 --> 08:19.317
<b>you should be plenty capable 
of dealing with them now.</b>

08:19.817 --> 08:25.567
<b>Will you show me why you're 
known as our Defense Hero?</b>

08:25.847 --> 08:28.277
<b>Yes, as you wish.</b>

08:29.717 --> 08:32.327
<b>Isla, Queen of Bugs,</b>

08:32.327 --> 08:35.927
<b>shall live up to your expectations</b>

08:35.927 --> 08:38.917
<b>and thoroughly defeat 
all of our foes for you.</b>

08:42.567 --> 08:44.547
<b>I'm sure you'll be fine,</b>

08:44.547 --> 08:48.327
<b>but be wary of any attacks 
rooted in RPG mechanics.</b>

08:49.847 --> 08:53.887
<b>That reminds me. They did catch 
Atou off guard, didn't they?</b>

08:53.887 --> 08:55.447
<b>I understand.</b>

08:55.447 --> 08:57.557
<b>I'll be quite careful.</b>

08:58.017 --> 08:59.687
<b>Mother...</b>

08:59.687 --> 09:02.007
<b>Don't give me that look.</b>

09:02.007 --> 09:04.127
<b>I'll make sure I come home.</b>

09:04.127 --> 09:05.527
<b>I promised you, right?</b>

09:05.827 --> 09:06.597
<b>Yeah!</b>

09:06.597 --> 09:09.487
<b>We'll take care of 
the king and wait for you!</b>

09:10.377 --> 09:11.497
<b>Please do.</b>

09:11.497 --> 09:12.417
<b>Yes!</b>

09:17.567 --> 09:19.957
<b>Now then, I'll be heading out!</b>

09:32.947 --> 09:35.557
<b>Man, this is one creepy forest.</b>

09:35.557 --> 09:41.927
<b>Why did we have to split away from Sir Ice 
Rock and invade this place on our own?</b>

09:41.927 --> 09:43.787
<b>About that...</b>

09:43.787 --> 09:44.527
<b>Huh?</b>

09:44.997 --> 09:49.617
<b>There's a good chance this operation 
doesn't have the Demon Lord's permission.</b>

09:49.617 --> 09:50.867
<b>Huh?!</b>

09:51.157 --> 09:54.617
<b>The boss might be planning 
to betray the Demon Lord.</b>

09:54.617 --> 09:57.617
<b>Seriously?! Why would he do that?</b>

09:57.617 --> 10:01.337
<b>Do you remember when we 
first came to this world?</b>

10:01.337 --> 10:02.497
<b>Yeah.</b>

10:02.497 --> 10:06.297
<b>One moment, we were all here 
in the same place. Right?</b>

10:07.067 --> 10:10.287
<b>Apparently, it was different for 
the boss and the Demon Lord.</b>

10:10.287 --> 10:11.137
<b>Hmm?</b>

10:15.877 --> 10:17.647
<b>Scouts?</b>

10:17.647 --> 10:20.147
<b>Wait! Something's off.</b>

10:23.517 --> 10:27.437
<b>Wh-What's happening to me?</b>

10:29.657 --> 10:32.117
<b>What happened to you?!</b>

10:32.547 --> 10:35.017
<b>I-I...</b>

10:37.217 --> 10:38.807
<b>Halt right there!</b>

10:42.747 --> 10:44.447
<b>What are these things?!</b>

10:51.397 --> 10:52.137
<b>Shit!</b>

10:52.137 --> 10:52.947
<b>Retreat!</b>

10:52.947 --> 10:54.807
<b>Fall back and regroup!</b>

10:54.807 --> 10:56.257
<b>Y-Yeah!</b>

10:56.257 --> 10:59.597
<b>My, my, how pathetic.</b>

10:59.597 --> 11:00.557
<b>Who's there?!</b>

11:01.437 --> 11:03.707
<b>Retreating over just this?</b>

11:03.707 --> 11:08.027
<b>You all are part of the Demon Lord's 
army, the forces of darkness, aren't you?</b>

11:08.027 --> 11:09.527
<b>Where are you?!</b>

11:09.527 --> 11:11.407
<b>Show yourself!</b>

11:12.387 --> 11:14.197
<b>If you're the forces of darkness,</b>

11:20.807 --> 11:26.707
<b>then you need to be more beautiful, 
ruthless, and thorough.</b>

11:37.427 --> 11:38.227
<b>Hmm...</b>

11:38.947 --> 11:41.547
<b>They're not very nutritious, are they?</b>

11:41.547 --> 11:44.317
<b>I suppose I'd give them a thirty.</b>

11:45.777 --> 11:48.357
<b>I'm talking about your minions, you know?</b>

11:50.687 --> 11:54.157
<b>Uh-huh, that's an awful 
thing to say about 'em.</b>

12:01.147 --> 12:03.287
<b>Introduce yourself, freak.</b>

12:03.287 --> 12:09.147
<b>I serve the kingdom of Mynoghra, governed 
by the great King of Ruin, King Ira Takuto.</b>

12:09.147 --> 12:14.257
<b>I am one of its Heroes, Isla, Queen of Bugs.</b>

12:15.007 --> 12:16.047
<b>And you are?</b>

12:16.387 --> 12:21.097
<b>One of the Demon Lord Army's Four 
Generals, Flamin, the Flame Demon.</b>

12:24.017 --> 12:25.867
<b>The Four Generals!</b>

12:25.867 --> 12:27.977
<b>There really was one here!</b>

12:28.457 --> 12:29.357
<b>Huh?</b>

12:29.697 --> 12:36.087
<b>I thought there must be one of the 
leaders here with an army of this size.</b>

12:36.087 --> 12:39.237
<b>Just like Ice Rock was there in Dragontan.</b>

12:41.127 --> 12:43.997
<b>So what, that guy got taken out?</b>

12:44.317 --> 12:46.167
<b>Well, I ain't surprised.</b>

12:46.167 --> 12:48.807
<b>He was just a muscle-head anyway.</b>

12:48.807 --> 12:51.367
<b>Oh my, he was one of your allies, wasn't he?</b>

12:51.367 --> 12:53.667
<b>What an awful way to speak of him.</b>

12:55.127 --> 12:57.957
<b>He was always the weakest 
of us Four Generals.</b>

12:57.957 --> 13:00.857
<b>I've got a good two steps up on him.</b>

13:00.857 --> 13:04.637
<b>So if you're thinking I'll go down 
just as easily, you're dead wrong.</b>

13:04.637 --> 13:08.897
<b>Well, well, you sound awfully 
confident in yourself.</b>

13:12.237 --> 13:13.557
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:13.557 --> 13:19.277
<b>It'll be a cinch for me to murder you and 
drag that big shot behind you off his throne.</b>

13:19.277 --> 13:21.397
<b>What'd you call him again?</b>

13:21.397 --> 13:23.747
<b>King Ira Takuto, was it?</b>

13:27.287 --> 13:30.877
<b>That's quite a bark for a piece of trash.</b>

13:30.877 --> 13:33.997
<b>Don't get cocky, fly.</b>

13:54.747 --> 13:56.357
<b><i>So it's started.</i></b>

13:56.997 --> 14:01.317
<b><i>Isla is currently engaged 
with the Flame Demon, Flamin.</i></b>

13:58.947 --> 14:05.537
<b>Isla, Queen of Bugs</b>

13:58.947 --> 14:05.537
The Flame Demon,
 Flamin.

14:01.957 --> 14:05.537
<b><i>When you pit an RPG character 
against those from a 4X game,</i></b>

14:05.857 --> 14:09.957
<b><i>the 4X game characters are 
overwhelmingly stronger in combat.</i></b>

14:10.267 --> 14:13.497
<b><i>We've already confirmed that 
in the battle at Dragontan.</i></b>

14:13.497 --> 14:15.707
<b><i>It's only a matter of time 
before she defeats him.</i></b>

14:16.297 --> 14:42.027
<b>Larvae</b>

14:16.297 --> 14:42.027
<b>Larvae</b>

14:16.297 --> 14:42.027
<b>Larvae</b>

14:16.297 --> 14:42.027
<b>Larvae</b>

14:16.297 --> 14:42.027
<b>Larvae</b>

14:16.597 --> 14:19.857
<b><i>The Larvae not participating 
in the fight against Flamin</i></b>

14:19.857 --> 14:24.127
<b><i>are patrolling the Accursed Lands 
and defeating the invaders.</i></b>

14:24.717 --> 14:29.137
<b><i>Gia and the Warriors are deployed in
defensive formations around the capital.</i></b>

14:24.717 --> 14:42.027
<b>Head Warrior Gia</b>

14:29.137 --> 14:32.947
<b><i>Emle is handling the Dark 
Elves who evacuated.</i></b>

14:32.727 --> 14:42.027
<b>Brain Eaters</b>

14:33.467 --> 14:38.037
<b><i>The Brain Eaters are standing 
by close at hand.</i></b>

14:38.037 --> 14:42.027
<b><i>Everything's going smoothly... 
at least in theory.</i></b>

14:42.537 --> 14:44.297
<b>Hmm...</b>

14:45.327 --> 14:46.807
<b>My king?</b>

14:46.807 --> 14:48.957
<b>What are you thinking about?</b>

14:48.957 --> 14:51.587
<b>I wonder what it is?</b>

14:51.587 --> 14:54.847
<b>Something is nagging at me...</b>

14:55.557 --> 14:59.297
<b>Hmm, is anything sticking out to you two?</b>

15:12.447 --> 15:13.747
<b>Damn, man!</b>

15:13.747 --> 15:15.197
<b>This is totally crazy!</b>

15:15.197 --> 15:19.437
<b>Didn't know there were freaks 
like you in this world!</b>

15:22.397 --> 15:24.857
<b>Calling me a freaks is quite rude, you know.</b>

15:30.537 --> 15:33.727
<b>It's certainly not a term you 
should be using with a woman.</b>

15:34.217 --> 15:34.957
<b>Don't you agree?</b>

15:44.637 --> 15:46.857
<b>Cheeky bitch!</b>

15:48.867 --> 15:52.767
<b>It ain't fair if you get to 
be the only one with pawns!</b>

15:56.887 --> 15:59.367
<b>Summoning them at no cost?</b>

15:59.367 --> 16:01.437
<b>Now that's very much cheating.</b>

16:02.317 --> 16:05.457
<b>Might I ask you a question?</b>

16:05.457 --> 16:08.577
<b>Huh? We're trying to kill each other here.</b>

16:12.527 --> 16:14.857
<b>Now, don't be like that.</b>

16:14.857 --> 16:17.147
<b>My master wishes to know.</b>

16:21.017 --> 16:24.327
<b>Why did you attack us?</b>

16:31.597 --> 16:33.767
<b>Hey, now! What the hell?!</b>

16:33.767 --> 16:35.187
<b>You got no standards?!</b>

16:40.217 --> 16:45.107
<b>Splitting your forces away 
from Dragontan to attack us</b>

16:45.107 --> 16:47.977
<b>seems like a foolish strategy, doesn't it?</b>

16:48.937 --> 16:50.357
<b>You want to know why?!</b>

16:51.157 --> 16:53.077
<b>Don't you know?</b>

16:53.077 --> 16:56.637
<b>Or is your boss just hiding it from you all?</b>

16:56.637 --> 16:59.627
<b>Either way, I feel sorry for you, damn!</b>

16:59.627 --> 17:01.657
<b>Thank you for the warning.</b>

17:01.657 --> 17:06.377
<b>However, words like that aren't 
going to shake my loyalty.</b>

17:06.377 --> 17:08.707
<b>I knew that already!</b>

17:09.487 --> 17:10.647
<b>And you?</b>

17:10.647 --> 17:12.847
<b>What do you think about yourself?</b>

17:13.367 --> 17:16.487
<b>I don't quite understand the 
intent of your question.</b>

17:16.487 --> 17:19.107
<b>I take it you harbor doubts 
about your own state of being.</b>

17:19.107 --> 17:21.437
<b>Just answer the damn question!</b>

17:23.667 --> 17:26.397
<b>I am a Hero of Mynoghra,</b>

17:26.397 --> 17:30.217
<b>and the loyal servant of 
our king, King Ira Takuto.</b>

17:30.217 --> 17:33.197
<b>Nothing more, and nothing less.</b>

17:35.367 --> 17:37.617
<b>I hate that shit!</b>

17:37.987 --> 17:42.087
<b>Oh my, what do you hate so much about that?</b>

17:42.087 --> 17:44.167
<b>You call yourself his servant,</b>

17:44.167 --> 17:47.797
<b>but you're so goddamn full 
of pride and conviction!</b>

17:48.217 --> 17:50.887
<b>Huh? That's it.</b>

17:50.887 --> 17:54.187
<b>That's why I'm so pissed off.</b>

17:54.737 --> 17:56.707
<b>It's because you all are free.</b>

17:56.707 --> 17:58.657
<b>You serve your king of your own volition,</b>

17:58.657 --> 18:01.187
<b>and it's your own choice to 
dedicate your loyalty to him.</b>

18:02.647 --> 18:05.437
<b>Hey, how's that feel, anyway?</b>

18:05.437 --> 18:08.147
<b>Serving someone of your own free will?</b>

18:08.757 --> 18:12.097
<b>Ahh, so that's what the issue is.</b>

18:12.097 --> 18:16.817
<b>"Blissful" sums it up nicely.</b>

18:16.817 --> 18:22.477
<b>Nothing brings me greater joy 
than proving useful to my master.</b>

18:22.477 --> 18:23.627
<b>So?</b>

18:24.377 --> 18:26.297
<b>What about you,</b>

18:26.297 --> 18:32.997
<b>Mister Puppet, forced to dance to the 
strings of the role imposed upon you?</b>

18:33.897 --> 18:36.567
<b>It feels shitty as hell!</b>

18:37.517 --> 18:38.957
<b>However!</b>

18:38.957 --> 18:40.207
<b>Once I kill you—</b>

18:40.207 --> 18:42.127
<b>kill all of you here—</b>

18:42.127 --> 18:44.007
<b>then I'll obtain it too!</b>

18:44.007 --> 18:46.007
<b>I'll get my freedom!</b>

18:50.167 --> 18:51.317
<b>I see.</b>

18:51.317 --> 18:53.787
<b>So that's your intention then.</b>

18:53.787 --> 18:54.757
<b>Ah...</b>

18:54.757 --> 18:56.357
<b>How lovely!</b>

18:56.357 --> 18:59.247
<b>You're quite charming right now!</b>

18:59.527 --> 19:01.367
<b>Can it, fly!</b>

19:01.367 --> 19:05.237
<b>Burn up and be gone already!</b>

19:12.177 --> 19:13.897
<b>Got you!</b>

19:31.097 --> 19:33.107
<b>Is that it?</b>

19:33.107 --> 19:35.947
<b>That's the extent of your thirst for freedom?</b>

19:37.597 --> 19:39.897
<b>Don't you dare mock me!</b>

19:45.367 --> 19:46.707
<b>That's just not enough.</b>

19:46.707 --> 19:48.707
<b>If you truly want to kill me,</b>

19:48.707 --> 19:52.047
<b>you'll need to prepare 
at least five times more.</b>

19:58.767 --> 20:01.137
<b>You're out of MP, aren't you?</b>

20:09.397 --> 20:12.967
<b>I have one final message 
for you from my master.</b>

20:14.537 --> 20:18.237
<b>He says, "You took us too lightly."</b>

20:22.787 --> 20:24.947
<b>Is that true?</b>

20:25.917 --> 20:29.007
<b>We'll really obtain peace and freedom?</b>

20:30.427 --> 20:32.777
<b>If we offer up this world?</b>

20:36.157 --> 20:38.707
<b><i>Ah, in the end...</i></b>

20:39.207 --> 20:41.677
<b><i>I guess I'm nothing but a puppet?</i></b>

20:42.247 --> 20:43.637
<b><i>In that case...</i></b>

20:43.637 --> 20:47.147
<b><i>I'll dance my part until the very end!</i></b>

20:56.357 --> 21:00.327
You have defeated the Blazing General Flamin.

21:02.677 --> 21:03.857
<b>Phew.</b>

21:03.857 --> 21:05.667
<b><i>Good work, Isla.</i></b>

21:06.307 --> 21:08.447
<b><i>Oh my, Master!</i></b>

21:08.447 --> 21:10.547
<b><i>If you're speaking to me,</i></b>

21:10.547 --> 21:12.827
<b><i>then that means you were 
watching, weren't you?</i></b>

21:12.827 --> 21:14.627
<b><i>Yeah, you were splendid.</i></b>

21:14.967 --> 21:16.977
<b><i>Thank you very much.</i></b>

21:16.977 --> 21:20.587
<b><i>I gained another level 
from this battle as well.</i></b>

21:20.587 --> 21:22.807
<b><i>I'm thinking of obtaining a new skill—</i></b>

21:22.807 --> 21:26.807
Communication Error!

21:22.807 --> 21:26.807
You cannot use the chat function at this time.

21:27.237 --> 21:27.867
<b>Huh?!</b>

21:28.267 --> 21:29.017
<b>Huh?!</b>

21:40.887 --> 21:42.077
<b>What's happening?</b>

21:42.077 --> 21:43.077
<b>Huh?</b>

21:43.077 --> 21:44.617
<b>Mother?</b>

21:45.207 --> 21:47.617
<b>What are you two doing here?!</b>

21:47.617 --> 21:48.897
<b>We don't know!</b>

21:48.897 --> 21:51.527
<b>We were just with our king,</b>

21:51.527 --> 21:53.337
<b>s-so why?</b>

21:54.857 --> 21:56.137
<b>My children!</b>

21:56.137 --> 21:58.197
<b>Protect those girls!</b>

22:15.647 --> 22:18.317
<b>John Pickett 
Henry Lin 
Meagan Smith 
William Haggard 
Rei Miyasaka</b>

22:15.647 --> 22:18.317
